  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The peak wavelength emitted by a black body at temperature <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is true about the relationship between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> is proportional to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> is proportional to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> is proportional to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T^{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span> is proportional to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T^{-2}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
